$$ax = xay$$

and

$$ay = yax$$

Multiplying on the left by $x^{-1}$ and on the right by $y^{-1}$, we get

$$ax^{-1}y^{-1} = x^{-1}y^{-1}a$$

Therefore, $a$ commutes with $x^{-1}y^{-1}$.

